     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>No manual, just the Help tab. Basically,: choose the detector layout you want to test, insert some pilot values of the parameters and observe the effect on Results. Click through the different tabbed plots. It&#39;s designed for trial and error! In a couple of months time I may write an extended tutorial.</div><div>Murray<br></div></div>"
    ],
